OL,3,CMan fined over #140 for stealing
OL,4,CGreggs snacks
OL,6,FA man from Birmingham has been fined
OL,7,F#141 for stealing a Greggs sandwich
OL,8,Fand two bags of cookies worth #4.60.
OL,10,FCarl Brennan, 42, of Soho, was caught
OL,11,Fshoplifting at the outlet on June 16th
OL,12,Fdespite being issued a warning by
OL,13,Fstaff.
OL,15,FThe court heard Brennan ignored the
OL,16,Fwarning and "encouraged two other
OL,17,Fmales to enter and steal items" before
OL,18,Fleaving without paying.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/2
